  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01241",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "\"让世界变形的，绝不是什么认识嘛。\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"What warps the world is certainly not something like perception.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01241",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我情不自禁地冒着差点自白的危险反驳说，\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I could not help retorting, at the risk of almost confessing, \"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01241",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "让世界变形的，是行动。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What warps the world is action.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p01241",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "只能是行动啊。\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It can only be action.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
